<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Your Florida LLC is filed — {{ llc_name }}</title>
{% set footer_label = "Formation Package" %}
{% set hide_page_numbers = true %}
{% include "partials/document_styles.html.j2" %}
</head>
<body>
{#
  Wording source: "Operating Agreement Templates for Review" doc, rev 10,
  section "Formation Package: Cover Letter (Draft)". Do not edit the
  wording here without the same change being approved there.
#}

{% if draft %}
<div class="draft-banner">Draft wording, not yet approved. Not for customer delivery.</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="letterhead">
  <span class="brand">Damian Knowles Business Development</span>
  <span class="contact">hello@damianknowles.com · damianknowles.com</span>
</div>

<h1 class="letter-subject">Your Florida LLC is filed: {{ llc_name }}</h1>

<p>Hi {{ customer_first_name }},</p>

<p>{{ llc_name }} is now a Florida limited liability company. The Florida Division of Corporations filed your Articles of Organization on {{ filing_date }}, Document Number {{ document_number }}.
{%- if effective_on_filing %} Your company exists as of that date.{% else %} Its existence is effective {{ effective_date }}, the date you chose.{% endif %}</p>

<p>I review every filing myself before it goes to the state. This package is the record of what we filed for you, so keep it with your company records.</p>

<h3 class="minor">In this package</h3>
<ul class="tight">
  <li>Your Articles of Organization, as filed</li>
  <li>The state's filing confirmation</li>
  {% if includes_operating_agreement %}<li>Your Operating Agreement, ready to sign</li>{% endif %}
  <li>Your next steps: a one-page checklist of what most new Florida LLCs do after filing</li>
</ul>

<h3 class="minor">Your company at a glance</h3>
<table class="facts">
  <tr><th>Company name</th><td>{{ llc_name }}</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Document number</th><td>{{ document_number }}</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Filed</th><td>{{ filing_date }}</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Effective</th><td>{{ effective_date }}</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Registered agent</th><td>{{ registered_agent_name }}</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Principal address</th><td>{{ principal_address }}</td></tr>
</table>

<p><b>Your payment.</b> As promised, nothing was charged until your LLC was filed. Your card is charged {{ order_total }} today, and a receipt follows separately.</p>

<p>If anything here doesn't match what you expected, reply to this email or book a free 15-minute Formation Review: {{ booking_link }}.</p>

<p class="signoff">Damian Knowles</p>

</body>
</html>
